SOAPBOX: a very poor, I could not hear the U.S.A station.
SOAPBOX: The 1.8MHz band in Japan was expanded, and it was
SOAPBOX: the 3rd CQWPX CW contest. Thanks to the wider band.
SOAPBOX: As the number of sunspots increased, the nighttime
SOAPBOX: high-band conditions improved.
SOAPBOX: I have participated for more than 40 years.
SOAPBOX: I used my a micro very antenna on my balcony
SOAPBOX: of my condominium.
SOAPBOX: I think that Web site of CQ WW WPX pages was a
SOAPBOX: very good. I enjoy it!
SOAPBOX: But the only 48 hours of log dead end is a too
SOAPBOX: short! I desire 7 days of dead end of log.
